abstract: >
  Vortical Enclosure Dynamics (VED) is a theoretical framework
  proposing a generative order in which difference gives rise to
  gradient, motion, and spacetime. This release (v2.0) corresponds
  to the second edition of Vol.4, substantially revised in May 2026,
  introducing registered difference, trace formation, and local
  Differential Horizons as the core descriptive framework.
keywords:
